msgid "折返螺旋磁序（Folded Helix）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:5
#: b5794809f59f477c8b4cfbc3265ab9b9
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:7
#: 8ac98b33f41349b89cf201eeba43e1df
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:9
#: 2358ec78aff84043be525b6be8c49d70
msgid ""
"按层离散定义对称折返螺旋磁矩纹理。磁矩被限制在垂直于 `平面法向`"
"（`plane_normal`）的平面内，沿 `层轴`（`layer_axis`）方向在前半周期逐层按固定"
"角度旋转、到转折层后按相同步长反向旋转，形成一个\"先顺时针、到中间再逆时针"
"\"的三角相位轮廓。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:11
#: 6e8c5b713e8a4883bd0ce68c69dcc2fd
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:13
#: cf77be31e7214e078071b493e4c715ab
msgid "s(k)=\\begin{cases}k,&0\\le k\\le h\\\\2h-k,&h\\lt k\\lt2h\\end{cases}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:15
#: d44a6b17406c4cdfb65e33e78d0417a6
msgid "\\phi(k)=\\phi_0+\\sigma\\cdot s(k)\\cdot\\Delta\\phi"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:17
#: 38fd7cefb9e24436921cc87e5c3f683f
msgid ""
"默认 `half_period_mode = Auto from layer count`，会在当前层范围上自动构造首尾"
"闭合的折返周期。"
msgstr ""
"With the default `half_period_mode = Auto from layer count`, the card "
"derives a folded period from the detected layers so that the phase closes "
"from the first layer to the last."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:19
#: 3dae96881fec4768b803d3fde01c16b2
msgid ""
"其中 $k$ 是离散层号，$h$ 是半周期层数，$\\Delta\\phi$ 是相邻层转角， $"
"\\sigma=\\pm1$ 控制手性，$\\phi_0$ 是全局初相位。$s(k)$ 的三角形轮廓正是“前半"
"段 递增、后半段折返”的来源。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:23
#: 62c938c24ea54a309b1eb9376cf9c3de
msgid ""
"**和 `Spin Spiral` 的区别：** `Spin Spiral` 沿传播轴连续旋转（单向、不折"
"返）。本卡生成的是\"走一段、折回来\"的分层离散纹理，更适合二维磁体、异质结界"
"面或需要镜像对称磁矩分布的场景。"
msgstr ""
"**How this differs from `Spin Spiral`:** `Spin Spiral` rotates continuously "
"and in one direction along its propagation axis. This card creates a layer-"
"discrete texture that advances and then folds back, making it better suited "
"to two-dimensional magnets, heterostructure interfaces, and mirror-symmetric "
"moment distributions."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:25
#: 9cea3c5f885140e7a9b85a83416a6e04
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:27
#: 05bd078e9c9142f49824e0e257aeb1a1
msgid "场景：层状反铁磁模型在非均匀自旋纹理上预测崩塌"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: a layered antiferromagnetic model fails on nonuniform spin textures"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:29
#: 395f073f77864fb8a9f16d8986471221
msgid ""
"你训练了一个层状磁性模型（如 CrI3 双层），训练数据里层内是 FM、层间是 AFM——这"
"是完美均匀的磁序。但实验发现施加电场后，顶层磁矩偏了 15 度而底层偏了 -15 度——"
"这是一个非单调的、分层的自旋纹理。模型对此完全无法预测。"
msgstr ""
"Suppose you trained a model for a layered magnet such as bilayer CrI3. Its "
"training data are ferromagnetic within each layer and antiferromagnetic "
"between layers: perfectly uniform magnetic order. Under an applied electric "
"field, however, the top-layer moments may tilt by 15° while the bottom-layer "
"moments tilt by −15°. This is a nonmonotonic, layer-dependent spin texture "
"that the model has never learned."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:31
#: d7b3a63eb8664741a037c8199df2f728
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 训练集里的自旋变化是单调的（要么全同向、要么交替翻转）。模型从"
"未见过磁矩方向在空间中\"先转过去、再转回来\"的纹理。需要生成按层离散的折返螺"
"旋构型，让模型学习分层磁矩分布的能量面。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Spin variation in the training set is monotonic: moments are "
"either aligned or alternate between opposite directions. The model has never "
"seen a texture whose direction rotates away and then returns. Generate layer-"
"discrete folded helices so the model can learn the energy surface associated "
"with nonuniform moment distributions across layers."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:33
#: eb1688cf71fe4323a6c91dab523f9714
msgid ""
"**输入：** 一个已有 `initial_magmoms` 的层状磁性结构（或通过 "
"`magnitude_source = Map/default magnitude` 指定磁矩模长）"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A layered magnetic structure with `initial_magmoms`, or a "
"structure for which moment magnitudes can be supplied with `magnitude_source "
"= Map/default magnitude`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:35
#: 68efe990c3dc4180ba144604640c62d9
msgid ""
"**目标：** 用 auto 模式自动适配当前层数，生成 3 个层间转角（15/30/45 度）、4 "
"个全局相位（0/30/60/90 度）、2 种手性顺序，共 3x4x2 = 24 个折返螺旋构型"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Let automatic mode adapt to the detected layer count and generate "
"three interlayer rotation angles (15°, 30°, and 45°), four global phases "
"(0°, 30°, 60°, and 90°), and two chirality sequences, for a total of 3 × 4 × "
"2 = 24 folded-helix configurations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:37
#: 85d149b46146403b9672570603b42caa
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:38
#: bd51024bf9864049b5b772ff96d86a39
msgid "`Layer Axis` = `[0, 0, 1]`（沿 z 轴分层）"
msgstr "`Layer Axis` = `[0, 0, 1]` (identify layers along *z*)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:39
#: 68871b9663f34d45b7bf4b070c5c4664
msgid "`平面法向`（`plane_normal`） = `[0, 0, 1]`（磁矩在 xy 面内旋转）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:40
#: 5df5fd60acf6426bad08605f36a3a780
msgid "`Half-Period Mode` = `Auto from layer count`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:41
#: 6880012f276242909cf6f59db62d27f3
msgid "`角度步长范围`（`angle_step_range`） = `[15, 45, 15]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:42
#: 9fde7eab93594ef791394d8993a6e754
msgid "`Phase Range` = `[0, 90, 30]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:43
#: 61820f43e0944c87b3e57ca55f81b06e
msgid "`Sequence` = `Both`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:45
#: 3a5b0ef2e0674c40bd5cc8d48c7ba90f
msgid ""
"**输出：** 24 个结构，磁矩在 xy 面内按层折返旋转，带 "
"`FoldedHelix(h=...,da=...,ph=...,seq=...,ax=...,pn=...)` 标签。"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** 24 structures whose moments fold back layer by layer in the *xy* "
"plane, labeled `FoldedHelix(h=...,da=...,ph=...,seq=...,ax=...,pn=...)`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:47
#: 83604caafff4472492a688be1ee263af
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:48
#: 3ebdfebc90fb4b789bb9e3440197ed2b
msgid ""
"重训后跑几组不同层间转角的测试构型，能量排序应合理（近 FM 的转角能量低，近 "
"180 度的高）"
msgstr ""
"After retraining, evaluate several test configurations with different "
"interlayer angles. Their energy ordering should be physically reasonable for "
"the target system—for example, angles near its preferred FM alignment should "
"be lower than strongly misaligned states."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:49
#: 88586b4b57bf40fa943dc1ec8f7417df
msgid ""
"抽查输出：层 0 磁矩方向 = 全局相位，中间层达到最大转角，顶层回到接近全局相位"
msgstr ""
"Inspect several outputs: layer 0 should start at the global phase, the "
"middle layer should reach the largest rotation, and the top layer should "
"return close to the global phase."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:50
#: cfec438477d8424e89c1dd848710cef1
msgid ""
"如果 auto 模式给出的半周期不合适——比如你的结构有 10 层但 auto 给了 h=4——切到 "
"manual 模式手动指定 `半周期层数`（`half_period_layers`）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:52
#: b1751fd4f61945b3953e760123fb69c5
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:54
#: f2144a499baf407b930d4c27e714bb48
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:55
#: 4319824743f94f1b9f3397f8696cd7ed
msgid "层状磁体（vdW 磁体、异质结、超晶格）需要非单调的分层磁矩纹理"
msgstr ""
"A layered magnet, such as a van der Waals magnet, heterostructure, or "
"superlattice, needs a nonmonotonic layer-dependent moment texture."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:56
#: e720e38158774d43a49396bf9e3dd5f6
msgid "想构造镜像对称的自旋分布（两半周期互为镜像）"
msgstr ""
"You want a mirror-symmetric spin distribution whose two half-periods reflect "
"one another."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:57
#: d40247b64cc249468a7b4fa3fc7685b3
msgid "需要同层原子共享磁矩方向（layer-locked 行为是内置的）"
msgstr ""
"Atoms in the same layer should share one moment direction; layer locking is "
"built in."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:59
#: fa95d5bd9df74e738667a68a1db1866f
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:60
#: 2008f8093ffb43308d255eb94436d232
msgid "需要标准单向传播的螺旋 → 用 `Spin Spiral`"
msgstr ""
"You need a conventional one-way propagating spiral → use `Spin Spiral`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:61
#: 569d07ae5098440688344a555a63685e
msgid "需要连续坐标依赖的相位（非分层）→ 用 `Spin Spiral` 的 continuous 模式"
msgstr ""
"You need a phase that varies continuously with position rather than by layer "
"→ use the continuous mode of `Spin Spiral`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:62
#: 3c0fdf9b24ca4813be68a6e0bf10e162
msgid "体系没有层状结构 → 分层无意义"
msgstr ""
"The structure is not layered, so a layer-based texture has no physical "
"meaning."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:64
#: 07c9bb1805d2429d97bdc2e0e1f771e5
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:66
#: e0131e9323704aab80bff70f095df502
msgid "分层定义"
msgstr "Layer definition"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:68
#: 6ccd4d4d26484520961d92a38a9369b5
msgid "层轴（layer_axis）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:70
#: b01af3ae5fe643fd9d8d72cc17584d95
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`。原子坐标"
"沿此方向投影后用于分层，格式 `[x, y, z]`。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. "
"Direction onto which atomic positions are projected to identify layers, "
"expressed as `[x, y, z]`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:72
#: 9b184f5530cb469882b6d73b9b9ce79c
msgid "平面法向（plane_normal）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:74
#: 970c7faceaa947f2afa6186f1545be42
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`。磁矩旋转"
"平面的法向。例如 `[0, 0, 1]` 表示磁矩在 xy 面内旋转。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. "
"Normal vector of the plane in which moments rotate. For example, `[0, 0, 1]` "
"constrains them to the *xy* plane."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:76
#: 9b2111dd4e24491bb9b5bad927931f7a
msgid "层容差（layer_tolerance）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:78
#: d0fc8e1410124afbac8d1f16f7c19fa1
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.05`。投影坐标差不超过此阈值的原子归为同一层，单位 Å。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `0.05`. Atoms whose projected coordinates differ by no "
"more than this tolerance are assigned to the same layer. Unit: Å."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:79
#: c1558e0cfbf74373b38a7f43c5068f98
msgid "保守：`0.01`（严格分层）"
msgstr "Conservative: `0.01` (strict layer separation)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:80
#: fc4cb416bd4d4bcab80f0faeb28b964c
msgid "平衡：`0.03~0.10`（容忍小幅层内起伏）"
msgstr "Balanced: `0.03–0.10` (allows modest intralayer rumpling)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:81
#: cee3e17f99bc45b1b0e128fffbbdc47a
msgid "如果层内有明显 rumpling，适当放宽"
msgstr ""
"Increase the tolerance if atoms within a layer show appreciable rumpling."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:83
#: 2cd161b74b0f4abe967adca64fc76b3f
msgid "半周期控制"
msgstr "Half-period control"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:85
#: def77120d66049d59bcc61ab445b340c
msgid "半周期模式（half_period_mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:87
#: e0062b937ec9408d9809de747b80e989
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Auto from layer count'`。`Auto from layer count` 由当前层数自动"
"推导半周期，保证首尾闭合（大多数情况推荐这个）。`Manual` 手动指定 `半周期层数"
"`（`half_period_layers`）扫描范围，适合比较不同折返周期。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:89
#: 705fcacbd34749298f374ea24673f18f
msgid "半周期层数（half_period_layers）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:91
#: 8011691e73574b3aaeeabf9ead1e35e4
msgid ""
"`list[int] | tuple[int, int, int]`，默认 `(2, 4, 1)`。仅在 manual 模式下生"
"效。`[min, max, step]` 格式，半周期的层步进数。"
msgstr ""
"`list[int] | tuple[int, int, int]`, default: `(2, 4, 1)`. Used only in "
"manual mode. Expressed as `[minimum, maximum, step]`, it scans the number of "
"layer intervals in one half-period."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:92
#: 5e69481bb20148baa5a3b21acdd1a3f7
msgid "保守：`[2, 2, 1]`（最短折返）"
msgstr "Conservative: `[2, 2, 1]` (shortest fold)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:93
#: ec391140fd7e498b820e5450e5efe737
msgid "平衡：`[2, 6, 1]`"
msgstr "Balanced: `[2, 6, 1]`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:94
#: d86457a781cf493e91999e64d0f2dbd7
msgid "探索：`[4, 12, 2]`"
msgstr "Exploratory: `[4, 12, 2]`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:96
#: f434c70ac8d64311b45bd970b9b350c0
msgid "旋转参数"
msgstr "Rotation parameters"

