msgid "序列方式（sequence_mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:114
#: 72406727572f494fbebcb85e22e5e51a
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Clockwise then counterclockwise'`。`Clockwise then "
