msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Clockwise then counterclockwise'`. `Clockwise then "
"counterclockwise` uses clockwise rotation in the first half-period and "
"counterclockwise rotation in the second. `Counterclockwise then clockwise` "
"reverses that order. `Both` generates both sequences."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:116
