"magmoms` to reuse stored moments or `Map/default magnitude` to create "
"magnitudes from an element map."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:122
