"`Magnetic Order` → `Folded Helix`: establish local FM/AFM moment magnitudes, "
"then rotate them in a folded layer pattern."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:210
#: e952762484ab479b969249aa74e68a14
msgid ""
"`Set Magnetic Moments` → `Folded Helix`：手动指定元素模长，再生成折返纹理"
msgstr ""
"`Set Magnetic Moments` → `Folded Helix`: assign element-specific magnitudes "
"manually, then generate the folded texture."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:211
#: c411f743e37c4b3ab987479fbc55f6ea
