msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:215
#: a0ec691b39774c8f9f0ff6815ad02c9c
msgid ""
"**输出只有原始输入。** 磁矩幅值全为 0。检查 `磁矩大小来源`"
"（`magnitude_source`）和 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）。结构只有 1 层时折返无"
"意义——至少需要 2 层。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:217
#: a35b37b031284fe5bdb2aa450e167d48
msgid ""
"**分层结果不符合预期。** `层轴`（`layer_axis`）方向是否正确？调整 `层容差`"
"（`layer_tolerance`）——太小把同层拆散，太大把不同层合并。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:219
#: 74776b6495d04feba668cf9aa275bb71
msgid ""
"**auto 模式的半周期太小或太大。** auto 模式取 `(总层数 - 1) // 2`。如果结构有"
"偶数层且你期望一个层作为转折峰，切到 manual 模式手动指定 `半周期层数`"
"（`half_period_layers`）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:221
#: 68a751ebad4848d0a75d9f02b1a7bd7b
msgid ""
"**输出相位看起来没有折返。** 如果层数太少（如 3 层），折返曲线不明显。用 6 层"
"以上的结构效果更直观。"
msgstr ""
"**The output phase does not appear to fold.** With very few layers, such as "
"three, the triangular profile is difficult to see. A structure with at least "
"six layers makes the fold clearer."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:223
#: 08e2a732a30b47c1964e95f9dd730f0d
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:225
#: b44b61183a354302868ab90813af0da0
msgid "`FoldedHelix(h=...,da=...,ph=...,seq=...,ax=...,pn=...)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:226
#: 8d69553705a54a99a89adffee1f9602b
msgid "`h`：半周期层步数"
msgstr "`h`: number of layer intervals in one half-period"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:227
#: 480621b92e6646b08e559218cf28aabe
msgid "`da`：层间转角"
msgstr "`da`: interlayer rotation angle"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:228
#: 5dc040b63f6e4d8985cf4b89f3c42653
msgid "`ph`：全局相位"
msgstr "`ph`: global phase"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:229
#: 991836372a304e6b8aa6972948ca20e7
msgid "`seq`：手性顺序（`cw-ccw` 或 `ccw-cw`）"
msgstr "`seq`: chirality sequence (`cw-ccw` or `ccw-cw`)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:230
#: ff39570ac2f74ed3920a52860e9085cc
msgid "`ax`：分层轴标签"
msgstr "`ax`: layer-axis label"

